<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Be strong in the Lord! rejoicing in His might,</l><l>Be loyal and true day by day;</l><l>When evils assail, be valiant for the right,</l><l>And He will be our strength and stay.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Confide in His Word, His promises so sure;</l><l>In Christ they are yea and amen;</l><l>Though earth pass away, they ever shall endure,</l><l>’Tis written o’er and o’er again.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Abide in the Lord, secure in His control,</l><l>’Tis life everlasting begun;</l><l>To pluck from His hand the weakest, trembling soul,</l><l>It never, never can be done!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
